        "Content": "Entrance Hall\r\nTimber flooring, alarm and storage closet.\r\n\r\nGuest Wc\r\nTiled floor, wc, whb, wall mounted mirror and shaver light.\r\n\r\nLiving Room \r\nLight filled room with timber flooring, box bay window, television point and double door access to rear garden.\r\n\r\nKitchen & Dining Room\r\nTimber flooring, fitted floor and wall units, granite countertop, tiled splashback, Neff oven and 4 plate hob, extractor fan, Neff dishwasher, fridge freezer and spot lighting.\r\n\r\nUtility Room\r\nTimber flooring, storage and Samsung washing machine.\r\n\r\nLanding\r\nFitted carpet, storage closet and Stira access to attic.\r\n\r\nBedroom 1\r\nDouble bedroom with fitted carpet, wall lights x 2 and generous storage.\r\n\r\nEnsuite \r\nTiled floor, partially tiled walls, step in shower, whb with vanity unit, wc, chrome heated towel rail, wall mounted mirror and shaver light.\r\n\r\nBedroom 2\r\nDouble bedroom with fitted carpet and storage.\r\n\r\nBedroom 3\r\nSingle bedroom with fitted carpet and storage.\r\n\r\nFamily Bathroom \r\nTiled floor, partially tiled walls, bath with shower attachment, wc, whb with vanity unit, chrome heated towel rail, wall mounted mirror and shaver light."
